{"id":"vera_ngstigt","lemma":"verängstigt","pos":"adj","rank":3344,"glosses":["frightened, scared, anxious"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7c/De-ver%C3%A4ngstigt.ogg/De-ver%C3%A4ngstigt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sie war noch nie so verängstigt.","en":"She'd never been so frightened.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"never, never at all"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Die Kinder sind wirklich verängstigt.","en":"The kids are really scared.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"kid","l":"Kind"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"really, actually"},null]},{"text":"Das Tier war verängstigt und verwirrt.","en":"The animal was scared and confused.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"animal"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"confused"}]},{"text":"Ich glaube, alle sind verängstigt.","en":"I think everybody's scared.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich war zu verängstigt, um etwas zu tun.","en":"I was too scared to do anything.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"to / too"},null,{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"something"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to do"}]}]}